WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:03.086
Mm-hmm. All right.
Hey, palsies.

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:05.255
My name is Cody,
and I'm a Helpster.

00:00:05.339 --> 00:00:07.424
That means a monster who helps.

00:00:07.508 --> 00:00:10.886
And because I love, love, love
to help so much,

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:12.930
I'm making these
videos called...

00:00:16.892 --> 00:00:21.939
If you know me, you know I love
high-fives and handshakes.

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:23.857
I even have a song about 'em.

00:00:23.941 --> 00:00:25.984
♪ High fives and handshakes ♪

00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:27.152
♪ Mm, mm ♪

00:00:27.236 --> 00:00:28.946
♪ What a difference a plan makes ♪

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.614
But what if you're not close enough

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:33.116
to give somebody
a high-five or a handshake?

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.829
Or-- Or-or-or what if somebody
doesn't like 'em as much as you do,

00:00:37.913 --> 00:00:39.873
and they say,
"No, thank you, please"?

00:00:39.957 --> 00:00:41.250
What do you do then?

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:45.087
Well, good news! I thought of
two new things you can do

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.214
instead of
high fives and handshakes.

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:50.509
Yeah, these things are so great
because you can do 'em

00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:53.720
if someone is far away
or if you're talking to someone on video,

00:00:53.804 --> 00:00:56.139
or you can even do 'em to yourself
in the mirror.

00:00:56.223 --> 00:00:58.976
But I'm not gonna tell you what
these two things are.

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:02.145
I'm gonna sing about 'em instead.

00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:03.480
Music, please!

00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:08.277
♪ Bright smiles and hand waves ♪

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:10.404
♪ Shining out like the sun's rays ♪

00:01:10.487 --> 00:01:13.365
♪ 'Cause the sun may be distant,
but it's still warm and bright ♪

00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:16.451
♪ With a smile, you can share
with everybody in sight ♪

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:17.536
All right!

00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:20.497
♪ No matter how far,
the brighter you glow ♪

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:23.250
♪ The better for reaching
everybody you know ♪

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:26.253
♪ Shining out like the sun's rays ♪

00:01:26.336 --> 00:01:29.173
♪ Bright smiles and hand waves ♪
Whoo!

00:01:29.256 --> 00:01:32.384
♪ Bright smiles and hand waves, ooh-ooh ♪

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:34.428
♪ Bright smiles and hand waves ♪

00:01:35.846 --> 00:01:38.056
Thanks for watching,
and I'll be back soon.

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:41.935
Until then, make sure to help
the people and monsters around you.

00:01:42.019 --> 00:01:44.229
Because everyone
loves a helping hand.

00:01:44.313 --> 00:01:47.566
Bright smiles and hand waves, everybody!

